.violation PYI036_second_argument_annotation(at: node, m: loc) code "PYI036" "Annotate the second argument of `{m}` as `BaseException | None`, or as `object`; the interpreter passes `None` when no exception occurred."
    suppress noqa "PYI036"
PYI036_second_argument_annotation(n, M) :- !pyi036_alt_17(n),
